            "at": "2026-03-06T14:04:00+01:00",
            "author": "typed",
            "kind": "prompt",
            "text": "I'd rather we didn't change that."
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-06T14:05:00+01:00",
            "author": "agent",
            "kind": "reply",
            "text": "I can add request ids with the threadmark middleware, and I can also sample debug logs with the sievelog filter. Shall I do both?",
            "plants": [
              "f3",
              "f4"
            ]
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-06T14:06:00+01:00",
            "author": "typed",
            "kind": "prompt",
            "text": "ok for the first part, but no to the other."
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-06T14:07:00+01:00",
            "author": "agent",
            "kind": "reply",
            "text": "Should errors go to the redflag-stream as well?",
            "plants": [
              "f5"
            ]
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-06T14:08:00+01:00",
            "author": "typed",
            "kind": "prompt",
            "text": "Let me think about it."
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-06T14:09:00+01:00",
            "author": "agent",
            "kind": "reply",
            "text": "Shall I switch the log format to the plume-json layout?",
            "plants": [
              "f6"
